            en: '“O Allah, I seek refuge in You from cowardice, I seek refuge in You from being returned to the most feeble age, I seek refuge in You from the trial of this world, and I seek refuge in You from the punishment of the grave.” Sa‘d ibn Abi Waqqas taught these words to his sons as a teacher teaches children writing, saying the Prophet ﷺ sought refuge with them after the prayer.',
